p=3: v_p(D(p^a)) for a=1..6 (computed mod p^7; value 7 means >= 7): [7, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2]
p=5: v_p(D(p^a)) for a=1..4 (computed mod p^5; value 5 means >= 5): [1, 1, 1, 1]
p=7: v_p(D(p^a)) for a=1..3 (computed mod p^4; value 4 means >= 4): [1, 1, 1]
p=11: v_p(D(p^a)) for a=1..2 (computed mod p^3; value 3 means >= 3): [1, 1]
p=13: v_p(D(p^a)) for a=1..3 (computed mod p^4; value 4 means >= 4): [2, 2, 2]
